ns\nL47: \nL48: Recipient Business Number:\nL49: \nL50: 701300956\nL51: \nL52: Recipient Type:\nL53: \nL54: For-profit organization\nL55: \nL56: Recipient's Legal Name:\nL57: \nL58: FPDynamics Advanced Robotics Ltd.\nL59: \nL60: Program:\nL61: \nL62: Innovation for Defence Excellence and Security Program\nL63: \nL64: Program Purpose:\nL65: \nL66: Collaborate with academic and private sector partners to build a network of expertise to support Canada’s current and future defence and security needs\nL67: \nL68: Value in CAD:\nL69: \nL70: 339480.0\n"
